{
 "_": "Objs that were named cert_<something> without being certificates, and what they are called now. Written by tools/renamecerts.py.",
 "why": "The unpacker names an obj after whatever sits at the previous id, so the obj one past a law talisman was called cert_law_talisman while really being a Rotten net. tools/pack/config/ObjConfig.ts derives the forward note link from that name, so it linked them: withdrawing a law talisman as a note handed over the Rotten net. The packer now requires certtemplate on the other end, and these names no longer claim something untrue.",
 "ids": "unchanged - only the name moved, so no save, drop table or map is affected",
